step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple mean combination on the full model pool to see baseline performance.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full model pool to see if it improves over the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean combination on the full pool to see if trimming reduces the influence of the few high‑error models.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full model pool using inverse_error weights to see if a simple inverse-error weighting improves over the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a DBA (dynamic Bayesian averaging) combination on the full model pool to see if it outperforms the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple mean on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if reducing model set improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the smaller pool1 using inverse_error weights to see if focusing on better models improves over mean on pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle on the full pool to see if a learned weighting improves over the simple inverse_error weighting.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a DBA on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if restricting to top 5 models improves robustness over the full pool DBA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 with inverse_error weighting to see if a slightly larger but still focused pool improves over the current best DBA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using inverse_error weighting to see if a full‑pool weighted scheme beats the current DBA leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean on the stable top‑5 pool to see if trimming further reduces the influence of the worst performers and improves SMAPE.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool1","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a median combination on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if a robust non‑linear aggregation improves over trimmed mean and weighted methods.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","models":["ARIMA","ETS","catboost","FT_rf","FT_catboost"]}

